<p:sld xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" xmlns:r="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships" xmlns:p="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/presentationml/2006/main"><p:cSld><p:spTree><p:nvGrpSpPr><p:cNvPr id="1" name=""><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{358780FC-9247-BBFC-FC3E-D7FCBB608EB5}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvGrpSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvGrpSpPr><p:grpSpPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="0" y="0"/><a:ext cx="0" cy="0"/><a:chOff x="0" y="0"/><a:chExt cx="0" cy="0"/></a:xfrm></p:grpSpPr><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="4" name="Title 3"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{41DCCD45-A4BA-7DC4-30C5-AB8A841648B1}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph type="title"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr/><p:txBody><a:bodyPr/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>INSTALLING A SIGA-AB4-LF</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="5" name="Content Placeholder 4"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{E8EA5804-AEAD-2094-5147-4F0DDC9E1CE9}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph sz="half" idx="1"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="1447330" y="2010879"/><a:ext cx="9605635" cy="4847122"/></a:xfrm></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr><a:normAutofit fontScale="70000" lnSpcReduction="20000"/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="457200" indent="-457200"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="200000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="600"/></a:spcBef><a:buFont typeface="+mj-lt"/><a:buAutoNum type="arabicPeriod"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>Select and install a compatible electrical box, and bring the field wiring into the box. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="457200" indent="-457200"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="200000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="600"/></a:spcBef><a:buFont typeface="+mj-lt"/><a:buAutoNum type="arabicPeriod"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>The default mode setting for the base is for fire alarms. To configure it for fire-plus-CO alarms, remove the MODE jumper. (See Figure 3 for jumper locations.) </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="457200" indent="-457200"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="200000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="600"/></a:spcBef><a:buFont typeface="+mj-lt"/><a:buAutoNum type="arabicPeriod"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>The default volume setting for the base is high dBA. To configure it for low dBA, remove the HI/LOW jumper. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="457200" indent="-457200"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="200000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="600"/></a:spcBef><a:buFont typeface="+mj-lt"/><a:buAutoNum type="arabicPeriod"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>Connect the field wiring to the terminals on the back of the base. For the unit to function properly, you must observe polarity. See Figure 3 and the diagrams in “Wiring” on page 3. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="457200" indent="-457200"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="200000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="600"/></a:spcBef><a:buFont typeface="+mj-lt"/><a:buAutoNum type="arabicPeriod"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>Attach the base to the electrical box. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="457200" indent="-457200"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="200000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="600"/></a:spcBef><a:buFont typeface="+mj-lt"/><a:buAutoNum type="arabicPeriod"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>Position the trim ring using the alignment marks, press the trim ring onto the base plate, and then turn the trim ring slightly until the tabs lock. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="457200" indent="-457200"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="200000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="600"/></a:spcBef><a:buFont typeface="+mj-lt"/><a:buAutoNum type="arabicPeriod"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>Position the detector using the alignment marks, press the detector into the base, and then turn the detector clockwise until it locks into place.</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree><p:extLst><p:ext uri="{BB962C8B-B14F-4D97-AF65-F5344CB8AC3E}"><p14:creationId xmlns:p14="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/powerpoint/2010/main" val="2075516296"/></p:ext></p:extLst></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>